[en.CHARACTER_MARE_NAME]
Mare

[en.CHARACTER_MARE_DESC]
The former mayor of Ponyville, mare, is a simple pony, she never did anything radical, and thus never did anything wrong. But fate always likes to tease her, due to the “Ghost Train Incident” on Spring, 1000, she was removed from her position by Cozy Glow, as she was considered dereliction of duty as the main responsible pony for the accident.
Later, she worked as a secretary in the Ponyville Town Hall for a while, but there was always a voice in her heart telling her that she should do something to make up for her mistakes. As Trixie became the District Governor of Ponyville, Mare, as Trixie’s deputy, also restarted her political career. This time, she will be more careful than ever, not only for herself, but also for the residents of Ponyville.

[zh.CHARACTER_MARE_NAME]
梅耶

[zh.CHARACTER_MARE_DESC]
小马谷前镇长梅耶是一只老实的小马，她从没做过什么激进的事，也就从没做过什么错事。但命运总是喜欢和她开玩笑，作为1000年春的幽灵列车事故的主要责任方，和煦光流以渎职为由罢免了她的镇长职务。
后来她在小马谷市政厅又做了一段时间的秘书，但她的心里一直都有个声音在告诉她，她应该做些什么来弥补她的过错。随着特丽克西升任小马谷大区区长，梅耶作为特丽克西的副手，也重新开始了她的政治生涯。这一次，她会比以前更加小心翼翼，不仅仅是为了她自己，也是为了小马谷的居民们。
